codex
The root cause is now concrete: this sandbox remaps process IDs, while Lean 4.22 asks `readlink("/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe")`; that path returns `ENOENT` although `/proc/self/exe` is valid. I’m applying a narrowly scoped preload shim that only retries that failed `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookup as `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the trusted preflight and all Lean commands. The shim does not alter files, terms, or proof checking.
apply patch
